+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright contributors to the vLLM project
+
+# Adapted from
+# https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/blob/main/src/transformers/models/olmo2/modeling_olmo2.py
